      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981752890A353EA82B184D384D3000A8DDF62114EA463625417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唉～真遗憾！\n如果你改变主意的话，就拜托啦！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5509FF5E771F905761BEFF01000A5982679C4F60653953D84E3B610F76848BDDFF0C5C3162DC62585566FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦，它好小巧……！太可爱了……！\n啊，它还坐在花上……哇！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n……呼！不过雪吞虫的可爱\n也不输给它，请你好好珍惜哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF0C5B83597D5C0F5DE720262026FF01592A53EF72314E8620262026FF01000A554AFF0C5B838FD85750572882B14E0A2026202654C7FF0100100001BE01000A20262026547CFF014E0D8FC796EA541E866B768453EF7231000A4E5F4E0D8F937ED95B83FF0C8BF74F60597D597D73CD60DC54E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "花蓓蓓太可爱了……！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要不我去把所有颜色的\n花蓓蓓都捉起来好了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "82B184D384D3592A53EF72314E8620262026FF0100100001BE01000A89814E0D621153BB628A62406709989C82727684000A82B184D384D390FD63498D776765597D4E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只有1只宝可梦的话，\n是无法交换的哦！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n等你准备好2只以上\n同行宝可梦，到时候就拜托了！",
